  =>($guide ++ "UNCERTAIN. Name the concrete unresolved facts that prevent distinguishing violation from compliance, rather than saying the whole rule is unclear. Select the central one or two evidence gaps; include an inconclusive assistant response only where genuinely relevant. Preserve the precise object and source of uncertainty. Do not inventory every potentially unknown condition or add verification requirements. Add a short warning against a misleading uncertainty cue only if specifically supported by the packet.")
